### Summary of changes

1. **`store/ui.js`** — Added `viewEditor: null` to state. Added two mutations:
   - `openViewEditor(view = null)` — sets `viewEditor` to `{ view }` (null view = create mode, view object = edit mode)
   - `closeViewEditor()` — resets `viewEditor` to null. Also excluded `viewEditor` from `saveState`.

2. **`ViewsMenu.vue`** — Removed all local dialog state. "Create new view" calls `$storex.ui.openViewEditor(null)`, "Edit" calls `$storex.ui.openViewEditor(view)`. No modal rendered here anymore.

3. **`Desktop.vue`** — Added `ViewProperties` import and overlay. Watches `viewEditor` computed from store. Renders `ViewProperties` as a centered modal when `viewEditor` is non-null, passing `viewEditor.view` as the `:view` prop. `closeViewEditor` dispatches `$storex.ui.closeViewEditor()`.
